165
00:10:21.541 --> 00:10:22.541
Exactly my point.

166
00:10:23.750 --> 00:10:25.125
Someone else must have fired.

167
00:10:26.125 --> 00:10:27.041
That's why...

168
00:10:30.875 --> 00:10:31.750
Take care.

169
00:10:35.000 --> 00:10:37.000
