the biggest crime in the world.

243
00:13:35.375 --> 00:13:36.208
{\an8}A sin.

244
00:13:36.416 --> 00:13:38.166
They don't feel like they can face anyone.

245
00:13:40.708 --> 00:13:41.583
Please...

246
00:13:42.166 --> 00:13:43.083
