01:05:48.750 --> 01:05:53.625
then why do we let children watch for
free, and charge adults money to see them?

1283
01:05:53.791 --> 01:05:54.666
What is all this?

1284
01:05:54.833 --> 01:05:56.583
What's going on here?

1285
01:05:56.750 --> 01:05:57.625
Look.

1286
01:05:58.125 --> 01:06:01.958
Religion, material world,
desire, and salvation...

1287
01:06:02.583 --> 01:06:04.500
are the four pillars of Sanatan Dharma.

1288
01:06:04.500 --> 01:06:05.708
And you call them vulgar!

1289
01:06:05.708 --> 01:06:09.750
Are you trying to imply
what your son did was right?

1290
01:06:10.541 --> 01:06:13.666
If the school had taught him well,
he could have done it better?

1291
01:06:14.166 --> 01:06:16.041
The school should teach him sex?

1292
01:06:16.166 --> 01:06:17.291
I object, sir.

1293
01:06:17.583 --> 01:06:19.875
Sex education is a science.

1294
01:06:20.375 --> 01:06:24.833
It imparts knowledge about the dos
and don'ts, and rights and wrongs of sex.

1295
01:06:25.000 --> 01:06:26.875
If the school had taught my child this,

1296
01:06:26.875 --> 01:06:28.625
he wouldn't have become the laughingstock.

1297
01:06:28.791 --> 01:06:31.708
In that case, you should
have sued the education system,

1298
01:06:31.708 --> 01:06:32.625
not the school.

1299
01:06:32.791 --> 01:06:34.000
Not again, sir.

1300
01:06:34.750 --> 01:06:36.750
Imagine you get run
over by a Tata truck.

1301
01:06:36.750 --> 01:06:37.750
- And it was the driver's mistake.
- My accident--

1302
01:06:37.750 --> 01:06:38.791
You lose your right leg.

1303
01:06:38.791 --> 01:06:40.625
- You get handicapped.
- Mr. Kanti--

1304
01:06:40.625 --> 01:06:43.458
Now would you sue the driver
or Mr. Tata?

1305
01:06:45.250 --> 01:06:48.625
They should be grateful
that I'm only asking for an apology.

1306
01:06:48.958 --> 01:06:52.000
They cannot even begin
to compensate for his mental condition.

1307
01:06:55.333 --> 01:06:57.041
Sir, please tell them to apologize...

1308
01:06:57.541 --> 01:07:00.125
and... deposit the money.
That's all.

1309
01:07:00.125 --> 01:07:01.291
Out of respect to you.

1310
01:07:05.083 --> 01:07:06.000
That's all.

1311
01:07:07.750 --> 01:07:08.958
He's saying that's all.

1312
01:07:09.916 --> 01:07:11.041
Why don't you sit here?

1313
01:07:13.666 --> 01:07:14.791
Ms. Kamini...

1314
01:07:16.166 --> 01:07:17.458
I think he has a point.

1315
01:07:19.125 --> 01:07:21.000
Mr. Kanti, you do have a point.

1316
01:07:21.416 --> 01:07:24.000
So, we must discuss this point.

1317
01:07:24.166 --> 01:07:26.791
Yes, sir. We should discuss this point,
and register the case as well.

1318
01:07:26.791 --> 01:07:28.291
Yes, Mr. Kanti.

1319
01:07:28.458 --> 01:07:30.333
You have a point.

1320
01:07:30.833 --> 01:07:32.500
So, I register your case.

1321
01:07:34.833 --> 01:07:37.041
Hail Lord Mahadev!

1322
01:07:37.416 --> 01:07:38.833
SHIVKALYAN HOUSING COMMITTEE

1323
01:07:42.708 --> 01:07:44.041
One rotten fish spoils the whole pond.

1324
01:07:44.041 --> 01:07:45.500
What happened?
Why is there a crowd here?

1325
01:07:45.500 --> 01:07:48.166
Who will be responsible if
our children follow in his footsteps?

1326
01:07:49.791 --> 01:07:52.166
We're being mocked all over the city.

1327
01:07:52.541 --> 01:07:54.000
The phone won't stop ringing.

1328
01:07:54.541 --> 01:07:56.041
I'm running out of excuses.

1329
01:07:59.416 --> 01:08:00.458
Hail Lord Mahadev.

1330
01:08:01.708 --> 01:08:03.708
Go ahead and defend your son, Kanti.

1331
01:08:05.375 --> 01:08:06.958
But not as an employee of this place.

1332
01:08:08.125 --> 01:08:11.250
We don't want people
to mistake your opinions

1333
01:08:12.000 --> 01:08:14.750
as my voice and opinion.

1334
01:08:15.625 --> 01:08:17.791
Please evacuate my shop and my house.

1335
01:08:18.041 --> 01:08:19.041
Hail Mahadev.

1336
01:08:19.208 --> 01:08:21.208
Shame on their upbringing!

1337
01:08:24.791 --> 01:08:25.708
Move.

1338
01:08:30.291 --> 01:08:31.333
Where will we go?

1339
01:08:32.166 --> 01:08:33.625
He is not our master.

1340
01:08:35.708 --> 01:08:36.541
He is.

1341
01:08:36.541 --> 01:08:37.583
Mahakaal.

1342
01:08:38.708 --> 01:08:40.083
Have faith.

1343
01:08:40.958 --> 01:08:42.666
You are Lord Shiva's disciple.

1344
01:08:52.125 --> 01:08:58.458
<i>With the lofty serpent
As garland around His neck</i>

1345
01:08:58.458 --> 01:09:01.791
<i>Along with His damaru
Shiva did the fierce tandava on the ground</i>

1346
01:09:01.791 --> 01:09:04.875
<i>Consecrated by the water flowing
From His thick, forest-like hair locks</i>

1347
01:09:04.875 --> 01:09:08.166
<i>Every moment, I bow to Lord Shiva
Whose forehead has a flaming fire</i>

1348
01:09:08.166 --> 01:09:11.291
<i>Who has a crescent moon on His head</i>

1349
01:09:11.291 --> 01:09:17.666
<i>The fire that is spreading out
Because of the breath of the snake</i>

1350
01:09:17.666 --> 01:09:24.083
<i>Wandering in whirling motion in the sky</i>

1351
01:09:24.083 --> 01:09:29.500
<i>Hail Lord Shiva!</i>

1352
01:09:36.958 --> 01:09:38.666
Lord Mahadev has brought you
to my home, sister-in-law.

1353
01:09:38.791 --> 01:09:39.666
Welcome.

1354
01:09:48.458 --> 01:09:51.708
Hail Lord Mahadev.

1355
01:09:55.416 --> 01:09:56.916
This is selfie mode, no?

1356
01:09:57.916 --> 01:09:59.375
Why can't I see my face?

1357
01:10:00.041 --> 01:10:01.083
Yeah.

1358
01:10:01.083 --> 01:10:02.625
- Did you get something to eat?
- No.

1359
01:10:02.916 --> 01:10:04.416
- I have got sweets.
- Can I have a bite?

1360
01:10:08.791 --> 01:10:11.083
So, do you know this gentleman?

1361
01:10:11.333 --> 01:10:12.291
No.

1362
01:10:12.791 --> 01:10:14.666
But I heard they are having
a really good discussion.

1363
01:10:15.208 --> 01:10:16.833
So, I came here.
What about you?

1364
01:10:17.250 --> 01:10:18.125
Same here.

1365
01:10:26.500 --> 01:10:28.500
Yeah. That's nice.

1366
01:10:33.750 --> 01:10:35.291
Ms. Kamini, just for the record.

1367
01:10:35.541 --> 01:10:37.750
I've never had such a crowd in my court.

1368
01:10:38.208 --> 01:10:40.625
So, I thought... let's capture the moment.

1369
01:10:40.791 --> 01:10:43.708
Hail Lord Mahadev!

1370
01:10:43.708 --> 01:10:44.750
Order. Order.

1371
01:10:44.750 --> 01:10:46.916
Ms. Kamini, proceed.

1372
01:10:47.333 --> 01:10:48.250
Thank you, sir.

1373
01:10:49.291 --> 01:10:50.791
Sir, before I proceed,

1374
01:10:51.208 --> 01:10:53.750
I would like to reconfirm once again.

1375
01:10:53.750 --> 01:10:56.833
Is the court and society

1376
01:10:57.291 --> 01:11:00.916
ready to have an open discussion on sex?

1377
01:11:01.458 --> 01:11:02.875
There is no going back afterwards.

1378
01:11:03.833 --> 01:11:05.833
Sir... sir.

1379
01:11:05.958 --> 01:11:10.041
It's something that's available
on the internet round the clock.

1380
01:11:10.041 --> 01:11:11.625
So, why would anyone object?

1381
01:11:11.750 --> 01:11:13.791
- Absolutely not.
- The whole world is watching.

1382
01:11:13.791 --> 01:11:15.250
- No one has an objection.
- It will be fun.

1383
01:11:15.250 --> 01:11:16.166
Good.

1384
01:11:16.333 --> 01:11:17.208
Very good.

1385
01:11:18.333 --> 01:11:20.291
Mr. Makwana. Bring him in.

1386
01:11:23.250 --> 01:11:24.208
That's the boy.

1387
01:11:24.333 --> 01:11:25.750
He was in the video.

1388
01:11:26.208 --> 01:11:27.333
Come, Vivek.

1389
01:11:29.625 --> 01:11:30.541
Don't worry.

1390
01:11:30.666 --> 01:11:32.125
You don't have to be afraid.

1391
01:11:35.375 --> 01:11:36.833
You don't have to worry at all.

1392
01:11:38.375 --> 01:11:41.500
Don't be scared.
Just answer her questions, okay?

1393
01:11:42.458 --> 01:11:43.375
Thank you.

1394
01:12:06.458 --> 01:12:07.458
Don't be afraid, Vivek.

1395
01:12:08.333 --> 01:12:09.166
How are you?

1396
01:12:11.416 --> 01:12:12.375
Missing school?

1397
01:12:14.333 --> 01:12:16.708
Tell me, do you
want to come back to school?

1398
01:12:17.416 --> 01:12:19.875
You won't have to sit
with the other kids in class.

1399
01:12:20.583 --> 01:12:24.041
The teachers will teach you
separately after school hours.

1400
01:12:24.500 --> 01:12:26.833
Like remedial classes.

1401
01:12:27.083 --> 01:12:27.916
Would that be okay?

1402
01:12:46.250 --> 01:12:47.833
Okay, tell me now, Vivek.

1403
01:12:49.458 --> 01:12:52.083
What you did in the school bathroom...

1404
01:12:53.583 --> 01:12:55.250
which everyone saw...

1405
01:12:55.583 --> 01:12:57.875
Everyone saw on the internet.

1406
01:12:58.000 --> 01:13:00.791
All your friends, all your neighbors.

1407
01:13:01.000 --> 01:13:02.458
Was it the right thing?

1408
01:13:05.875 --> 01:13:08.708
Is your school responsible
for what you did?

1409
01:13:12.291 --> 01:13:13.125
Yes?

1410
01:13:14.708 --> 01:13:15.583
Yes?

1411
01:13:16.958 --> 01:13:17.875
Yes?!

1412
01:13:20.250 --> 01:13:21.791
Vivek... Vivek!

1413
01:13:21.916 --> 01:13:23.833
- Vivek!
- You are insulting the court.

1414
01:13:23.958 --> 01:13:25.333
You can be punished.

1415
01:13:29.666 --> 01:13:33.083
Sir, we have top-class universities
in our country.

1416
01:13:33.375 --> 01:13:34.958
We have high-class education.

1417
01:13:35.458 --> 01:13:37.958
But has that reduced the crime rate?

1418
01:13:38.458 --> 01:13:40.666
Are heinous crimes like rape
not committed anymore?

1419
01:13:41.708 --> 01:13:43.000
No matter what happens,

1420
01:13:43.125 --> 01:13:46.166
why are schools
and the education system blamed?

1421
01:13:47.666 --> 01:13:51.250
Our history, literature, and scriptures
like <i>Ramayana</i> and <i>Mahabharata...</i>

1422
01:13:51.791 --> 01:13:53.416
enlighten us.

1423
01:13:54.333 --> 01:13:55.791
But can he guarantee that

1424
01:13:56.000 --> 01:13:57.791
there are no villains like Ravana
and Kamsa in our society?

1425
01:13:59.500 --> 01:14:01.125
Anyway, this argument is relevant

1426
01:14:01.125 --> 01:14:02.958
only if his son
is willing to come to school.

1427
01:14:03.583 --> 01:14:05.583
We are ready to give him admission.

1428
01:14:05.583 --> 01:14:06.791
We will take him back.

1429
01:14:07.625 --> 01:14:08.708
But is he ready?

1430
01:14:09.958 --> 01:14:12.208
He is so embarrassed that
he can't even look anyone in the eye.

1431
01:14:13.083 --> 01:14:14.583
So, what is this facade about?

1432
01:14:16.166 --> 01:14:17.125
That's all, sir.

1433
01:14:20.791 --> 01:14:25.416
{\an8}PURSHOTTAM NAGAR

1434
01:14:25.583 --> 01:14:28.583
{\an8}The court is adjourned till next Friday.

1435
01:14:29.958 --> 01:14:31.250
You just witnessed your son's condition.

1436
01:14:31.833 --> 01:14:34.083
Should I summon your wife
and daughter next?

1437
01:14:39.458 --> 01:14:40.833
This was no fun.

1438
01:14:41.458 --> 01:14:43.125
Ended even before it started.

1439
01:14:51.208 --> 01:14:53.916
<i>Fly away, crow</i>

1440
01:14:54.041 --> 01:14:55.291
Who is creating this nuisance?

1441
01:14:55.291 --> 01:14:58.291
God knows who is this junkie
singing at this hour!

1442
01:14:58.291 --> 01:15:01.666
<i>- Take my message...</i>
- Check who it is. Shoo him away.

1443
01:15:01.791 --> 01:15:04.333
<i>I'll be obliged</i>

1444
01:15:04.833 --> 01:15:06.791
- Hey, mister!
- <i>It's spring again</i>

1445
01:15:06.791 --> 01:15:10.791
- Keep quiet. It's bothering Indumati.
- <i>And the trees have started fruiting</i>

1446
01:15:11.333 --> 01:15:14.916
<i>Life is too short...</i>

1447
01:15:15.125 --> 01:15:17.833
- <i>And the nights are too long</i>
- Mister!

1448
01:15:17.833 --> 01:15:20.375
If you can't stop, at least
sing in a melodious voice.

1449
01:15:21.833 --> 01:15:23.833
Oh, it's you!

1450
01:15:24.750 --> 01:15:27.166
Why do you drink
more than you can handle?

1451
01:15:27.375 --> 01:15:28.333
Really?

1452
01:15:30.666 --> 01:15:32.291
Even Lord Kaal Bhairav drinks.

1453
01:15:32.750 --> 01:15:35.375
That's His holy offering.

1454
01:15:35.500 --> 01:15:37.750
This too is Lord Mahakaal's offering.

1455
01:15:37.750 --> 01:15:39.000
Please give me some.

1456
01:15:45.000 --> 01:15:46.500
Wow! This is nectar.

1457
01:15:46.916 --> 01:15:50.333
Wow! What a beautiful word!

1458
01:15:50.458 --> 01:15:51.458
Nectar.

1459
01:15:51.583 --> 01:15:55.291
Kanti, you should say
what society likes to hear.

1460
01:15:55.958 --> 01:15:58.875
Speak words that sound good.

1461
01:16:06.083 --> 01:16:10.416
Have you ever wondered
if the things you say, your philosophy,

1462
01:16:10.875 --> 01:16:13.250
make sense to everyone?

1463
01:16:13.750 --> 01:16:16.000
When I need to explain
something to someone...

1464
01:16:16.708 --> 01:16:17.833
they always understand.

1465
01:16:21.083 --> 01:16:22.500
Did you find your bag?

1466
01:16:23.375 --> 01:16:25.125
I'm not worried about the bag.

1467
01:16:26.458 --> 01:16:28.000
I'm worried about the person...

1468
01:16:29.583 --> 01:16:30.666
who has it.

1469
01:16:30.875 --> 01:16:32.166
Good night.

1470
01:16:33.041 --> 01:16:34.125
Good night.

1471
01:16:34.541 --> 01:16:38.125
<i>Come home, O traveler!</i>

1472
01:16:38.250 --> 01:16:41.416
<i>Without you my life's incomplete</i>

1473
01:16:41.708 --> 01:16:45.166
<i>Come home, O traveler!</i>

1474
01:16:45.333 --> 01:16:48.125
<i>Without you I am incomplete</i>

1475
01:16:50.625 --> 01:16:52.458
- Where is Damu?
- She's in the latrine.

1476
01:16:52.458 --> 01:16:55.291
Damiyanti Mudgal, come up to the stand.

1477
01:16:57.291 --> 01:16:58.791
Curse this society.

1478
01:16:59.458 --> 01:17:00.833
Absolutely shameless.

1479
01:17:01.083 --> 01:17:02.333
Summoning the daughter to court.

1480
01:17:05.333 --> 01:17:07.416
She will run out with teary eyes.

1481
01:17:07.833 --> 01:17:09.541
{\an8}PURSHOTTAM NAGAR

1482
01:17:17.958 --> 01:17:19.000
Don't be afraid, Damu.

1483
01:17:19.250 --> 01:17:21.375
Just two or three questions.

1484
01:17:23.000 --> 01:17:24.208
Is Vivek your brother?

1485
01:17:27.125 --> 01:17:28.083
What kind of a boy is he?

1486
01:17:29.500 --> 01:17:30.541
He's a good boy.

1487
01:17:30.958 --> 01:17:31.833
Good.

1488
01:17:32.458 --> 01:17:34.291
So, tell me one thing.

1489
01:17:34.416 --> 01:17:39.166
In this video, which is available
on the internet round the clock,

1490
01:17:40.125 --> 01:17:42.458
- what is your "good" brother doing?
- I object, sir.

1491
01:17:42.625 --> 01:17:45.916
How can she ask
such questions to a child?

1492
01:17:45.916 --> 01:17:50.041
So, you admit there's
something in this video

1493
01:17:50.166 --> 01:17:52.000
that's bad and vulgar,

1494
01:17:52.125 --> 01:17:55.333
- and it cannot be shown to anyone.
- No, I don't admit that.

1495
01:17:55.541 --> 01:17:57.291
But she can ask
such questions discreetly.

1496
01:17:57.458 --> 01:17:58.583
Why among so many people?

1497
01:17:59.041 --> 01:17:59.916
Why?

1498
01:18:00.291 --> 01:18:01.375
Is it because she's a girl?

1499
01:18:01.375 --> 01:18:02.625
- Lone female.
- No, you--

1500
01:18:02.833 --> 01:18:04.916
- Even I'm the only lady here...
- No, that's not--

1501
01:18:04.916 --> 01:18:08.708
From the video, it seems
that a young boy is secretly

1502
01:18:08.708 --> 01:18:12.416
using his hands
to achieve sexual arousal.

1503
01:18:35.958 --> 01:18:37.083
What is it called?

1504
01:18:37.750 --> 01:18:40.250
This process is called
jerking off, masturbation,

1505
01:18:40.375 --> 01:18:43.333
or "taking a selfie"
in our generation's slang.

1506
01:18:43.666 --> 01:18:44.791
What does it do?

1507
01:18:45.958 --> 01:18:50.458
This process releases hormones
like oxytocin and dopamine in the body,

1508
01:18:50.666 --> 01:18:55.250
leading to arousal, which causes
pleasure and results in sublime peace.

1509
01:18:56.833 --> 01:18:59.708
{\an8}Everyone does it for self-satisfaction.

1510
01:19:14.833 --> 01:19:18.041
Sir, she has been trained well.

1511
01:19:18.375 --> 01:19:21.708
{\an8}If the school had taught her, her
answer would have been the same.

1512
01:19:23.083 --> 01:19:24.166
{\an8}Order! Order!

1513
01:19:25.833 --> 01:19:28.416
Pay heed to the judge
and stop laughing.

1514
01:19:28.666 --> 01:19:30.541
{\an8}Ms. Kamini,
do you want to take it further?

1515
01:19:30.541 --> 01:19:32.375
No, sir.
You can go.

1516
01:19:33.625 --> 01:19:34.791
{\an8}Hail Lord Mahadev!

1517
01:19:38.291 --> 01:19:39.333
Where is Damu?

1518
01:19:39.333 --> 01:19:40.583
She's in the latrine.

1519
01:19:40.875 --> 01:19:42.791
Please, Mom!
Just call it the washroom.

1520
01:19:42.791 --> 01:19:44.791
That sounds disgusting.

1521
01:19:45.416 --> 01:19:46.416
What did I say?

1522
01:19:46.916 --> 01:19:47.958
Latrine!

1523
01:19:48.250 --> 01:19:50.750
- What else do I call it?
- Look...

1524
01:19:52.958 --> 01:19:54.291
Say what sounds pleasant

1525
01:19:54.291 --> 01:19:58.375
and what the society likes to hear.

1526
01:19:58.541 --> 01:20:01.625
- Yeah!
- What's music to the ears is good.

1527
01:20:02.250 --> 01:20:05.291
Similarly, something that seems
crass in one way of speaking

1528
01:20:05.833 --> 01:20:08.916
may appear better if put differently.

1529
01:20:09.583 --> 01:20:10.541
Understood?

1530
01:20:11.500 --> 01:20:12.541
Understood?

1531
01:20:12.875 --> 01:20:13.750
